Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /run/corosync-qnetd/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/corosync-qnetd/sshd.pid
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
AllowUsers root
AllowTcpForwarding no
GatewayPorts no
PermitTunnel no
X11Forwarding no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
